    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Despite inclement weather in Dar es Salaam, the Aga Khan University (AKU) Tanzania campus resonated with intellectual engagement and literary enthusiasm during its recent D.E.A.R. (Drop Everything and Read) Day. Organized by the AKU Tanzania Library team, the event fostered a vibrant celebration of reading, attracting over 56 students and staff.",
